{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And their pegs and their cords.</b> Of the pillars — for the pegs and cords of the hangings were in the porterage of the sons of Gershon. And there were pegs and cords for the curtains and for the hangings below, so the wind would not lift them; and there were pegs and cords for the pillars around, to suspend the hangings from them along their upper edge by means of hooks and rods — as is taught in the matter of the work of the Mishkan."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:24.830617211Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}